The trial is 14 days and it is set on the subscription, not on the
price, so it does not appear here.

Set these where the service runs:

STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER=price_1UJdGnLF1o1OftCsT6y1wOKH
STRIPE_PRICE_GROWTH=price_1UJdGoLF1o1OftCsMSwJFD1m
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO=price_1UJdGpLF1o1OftCsSrqEHz42

The VAT treatment of these prices is not settled. Set tax_behavior on each
price before anyone subscribes, because it cannot be changed afterwards.
